<title>JAPAN: Yaoko -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yaoko -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    31.37		vs	   28.74</p>
<p> Operating	    1.28		vs	    1.28</p>
<p> Current		1.24		vs	    1.23</p>
<p> Net		  607    million	  vs	  565    million</p>
<p> EPS		   30.23 yen	  vs	   28.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    8.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yaoko Co Ltd is a supermarket operator mainly handling foodstuffs and daily-use sundry goods.</p>
</text>
